@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Student" as student
actor "Administrator" as admin

rectangle "Smart Campus Study Room Booking System" {
  usecase "US-01: View Room Availability" as UC_View
  usecase "US-02: Book Study Room" as UC_Book
  usecase "US-03: Cancel Booking" as UC_Cancel
  usecase "US-04: Booking Confirmation" as UC_Confirm
  usecase "US-05: Block or Unblock Room" as UC_Block
  usecase "US-06: Review Room Usage" as UC_Review
}

student --> UC_View
student --> UC_Book
student --> UC_Cancel

admin --> UC_Block
admin --> UC_Review

' why: R4 requires every successful booking to produce a confirmation
UC_Book .> UC_Confirm : <<include>>

note right of UC_Book
  Rules:
  R1: Start time is in the future
      and duration is greater than 0
      and at most 2 hours.
  R2: Active bookings for the same
      room cannot overlap.
  R3: A blocked room cannot accept
      a new booking.
end note

note bottom of UC_Block
  Assumptions:
  - Touching bookings do not overlap.
  - Blocking prevents new bookings only;
    existing bookings remain valid.
  - Students cancel only their own bookings.
end note

@enduml